WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.830
"Strait of Messina"

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:35.030
- The sea sure is big!
- Yeah!

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:43.300
Jean-san said seeing
the sea makes him sad.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:48.340
How about you, Henrietta?

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:55.080
It makes me miss Giuse-san, I guess...

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.420
Yeah. It makes me miss Jean-san, too.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.740
I hear they're going to
demolish the survey bridge.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:33.760
Even after Giuse-san and I protected it...

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:39.090
They're also restarting construction
on the real bridge next month.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.670
How has Triela been lately?

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:52.540
Is she doing well in the dormitory?

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.530
She suffered major injuries in Milan.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:01.250
She hasn't been very cheerful since then.

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.900
Triela, is something the matter?

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.940
Oh... No. Nothing at all.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:26.930
Do you feel sick?

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.070
I'm fine!

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.800
Are you still not well?

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:52.790
I'm over most of the
drugs' side effects. But...

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:58.860
I don't feel any better,
even after beating my enemy.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:04.880
I wanted to beat him so badly, too.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:21.600
"May you not chase times past,
nor vex over what is yet to come."

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:25.930
Don't fret about the past.
Don't worry about the future.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:38.750
That's your philosophy, Claes.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:42.410
I think it's our philosophy, actually.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.430
You should've gone on vacation too.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.090
Yeah, maybe.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:57.200
Taormina in Sicily, was it?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.790
Yeah. Jean-san said
they have a villa there.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:14.940
I guess it doesn't matter, as long
as Henrietta and Rico have fun.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:44.770
"Fantasma"

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.910
"Taormina, Sicily"

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:55.760
I wish we could always
be together, Giuse-niisama.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.750
What makes you say that?

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:04.860
Father is too busy with work,
and Jean-niisama will be late.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:11.400
You're supposed to spend
vacations with your family.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.810
Enrica...

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:22.810
Whenever I feel lonely,
you're the only one there for me.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.730
Giuse.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:49.810
Hirscher called.
The ferry's arrived at the island.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.470
Okay.

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:08.160
Only a few hours left to relax.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:13.570
As a vacation, it's a bit short.
But that's how it always is.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:17.970
The only time we spent a month
here was when we were kids.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.960
Everyone was always busy.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.880
Hey, Giuse.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:28.870
Get the car. Let's visit the
amphitheater for old times' sake.

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:33.450
"Amphitheater"

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:44.960
This place brings back memories.
We always used to run around it.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.470
Hey, Giuse.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:55.840
Whenever I come to this city,
I remember our dead family.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.110
I only have family memories here.

00:06:58.110 --> 00:06:59.770
Yeah.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:06.260
It doesn't bother you? Surely it
brings back memories of Enrica.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:12.630
Brother, I come here so
I don't forget about her.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.620
That's how I'm able to
treat Henrietta with kindness.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.300
It's changed.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.510
What has?

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:31.510
Your attitude toward Henrietta.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:36.520
You've put something behind you.
You interact more naturally now.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:40.390
You were the one against doting over her.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.530
You didn't have it in you last year.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.860
I acknowledge all prudent
methods of interaction.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.190
I see.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:06.680
I hope the girls enjoy this time off.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:10.350
The cyborgs' conditioning
is very mentally stressful.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:14.120
I want to see if this sort
of thing can help reduce it.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:17.760
How is the second-stage
girl coming along?

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.960
You mean the new conditioning?

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:24.030
I hear they're lowering the dosages
and easing up on the restraints.

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:27.070
Reducing the load increases the life span.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:29.400
The chief has high hopes for her.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:02.540
- Giuse-san!
- Hi, Henrietta!

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:06.870
These past few days
without you felt so long!

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:15.980
Thanks for leading them around, Hirscher.

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:18.550
It's just another part of a Handler's job.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:21.260
What now? Will you stay at our place?

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:26.330
I'm going to take a plane back.
I left Triela alone at headquarters.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:30.320
I see. I can understand how that feels.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.240
Hello, Jean-san.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:43.710
I'm glad you're here. This is
a very rare vacation. Have fun.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.370
Yes, sir!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.510
- What a nice view!
- Isn't it, though?

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:44.800
Will I have to give my gun
up again, like last year?

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.010
Henrietta.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.080
Giuse-san!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.690
We decided to have dinner in the city.

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:00.280
Okay!

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.980
Umm...

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.500
You can take my gun.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.270
Oh. Okay.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:23.210
You said before that I should be
a normal girl while on vacation.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:27.050
No, you can keep it.

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:29.150
Okay!

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:32.140
Oh, I know! Check inside that closet!

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.350
Okay.

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.560
It's so cute!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:58.400
- Go ahead. Try it on.
- Thank you!

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.290
What's that, Henrietta?

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.260
Isn't it nice?

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:42.220
That outfit...

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:49.520
Umm, Giuse-san let me borrow it.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.640
Jean-san?

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:59.270
Oh. Giuse is outside getting the car.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:00.870
Okay!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.750
So Rico couldn't wait to
come here too! And then...

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.760
What should we do tomorrow?

00:13:55.760 --> 00:14:00.100
Sightseeing and shopping are
the only things we can do here.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:02.090
Take me to the sea!

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:06.510
Please.

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:09.010
All right. Let's do that.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.670
Okay!

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.170
Jean-niisama! You're leaving already?!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:41.780
Mountain training is beginning.
I need to return to Rome.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:45.550
Don't go! We're all finally here!

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:52.020
You promised the three of us
would go sailing this year!

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:57.360
Don't act so childish. You can
just go with Giuse tomorrow.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:07.760
Those were Enrica's clothes...

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:32.990
That was definitely going too far, Giuse.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:38.790
Was it really?

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:48.170
Enrica...

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:57.250
Giuse-niisama never forgets about me.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.190
Am I seeing things?

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:07.850
But you... You're terrible.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:28.150
I haven't forgotten!

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:32.480
Your heart is filled with
trying to avenge Sofia-san.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:40.260
But Giuse-niisama is terrible, too.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:43.930
Those clothes are mine...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.890
...but he's letting another girl wear them.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:59.780
He found a replacement
for me now that I'm dead.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.050
That's right!

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:04.380
He's apologizing to you
by doing his utmost for her!

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:14.760
That's nothing but self-satisfaction!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.230
What's wrong with that?!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:20.270
The dead only have to curse the living!

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.600
But the living are weak!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:31.710
This was the only way for
him to live with himself!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:36.050
I was the one who suggested it!
If anyone, blame me!

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.890
Jean-san?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:55.130
Is someone there?

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:03.270
No.

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.620
What's wrong?

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:14.660
I had a bad feeling for some reason,

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:17.990
and I heard your voice
when I came here...

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:24.190
Oh.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:56.130
The stars are so pretty!

00:18:56.130 --> 00:19:00.500
They look different than
they do at headquarters.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:03.810
We should've brought the telescope.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:08.710
Then I could've heard
another of your star stories.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.370
I can tell you some here, if you'd like.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:23.660
What's wrong?

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:30.660
Rico told me on the ferry
that the sea makes Jean-san sad.

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:43.000
It makes me lonely and uneasy.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:56.120
It's okay. I'm right here.

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:07.170
Right! It's no problem
when I'm with you, Giuse-san!

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.980
Giuse.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:21:00.360
I met an illusion of Enrica last night.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.020
Illusion?

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:10.330
I don't know if it was a
ghost or an illusion or what.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:11.990
Really?

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:18.030
It gave me a very harsh scolding.

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:23.310
Giuse-san!

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:27.350
It's been a while since we last
swam! Let's get some exercise!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.010
Yeah.

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:44.770
Do you remember when we
promised to go sailing with Enrica?

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:50.610
I remember. But you went back to Rome.

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:54.940
Shall we take a boat out
later, with the cyborgs?

00:21:57.450 --> 00:21:59.780
Yeah. Let's do that.

00:22:34.150 --> 00:22:49.160
A doll without a heart,
born from warm hands

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:58.440
I neither smile nor talk

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:06.610
I want you to hear
about these feelings someday,

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:14.660
though they can't be put into words

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:22.930
I'll summon all my strength

00:23:22.930 --> 00:23:46.450
to know what it means to live
